==Strategy==
You need to destroy the base in one hit in under a minute, or the overbuffed Brollows will come for you to end your run. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] is your best option along with a unit like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] that can clear the peons quickly without accidentally hitting the base. Timing the [[Cat Cannon]] to let a [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]] advance faster also helps.

For 4-crown, use [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] as your wave unit, or [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] should you have her [[Talents]].

